<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114847" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῡσίτης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, mostly in fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσῖτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like gold,
				containing gold,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ηάμμος χρυσῖτις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.102
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.2.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1424
				</span></i>
			<i>a.</i><i><span class="en">
				254
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. σποδός</span> a
			<i>yellow</i> powder used for the eyes, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.103
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					12.184
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσῖτις</span> alone, a form of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιθάργυρος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.87
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ χ.</span>
			<i>gold-dust</i> or <i>ore,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.526b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>touchstone, lapis Lydins,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.102
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσοκόμη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.55
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
